    <title>About me</title>
    <link href="/about/" />
    <updated>2025-02-05T16:28:41Z</updated>
    <id>/about/</id>
    <content xml:lang="" type="html">
      <h2>Hi, I'm Niha. I'm a data consultant based in Houston, TX.</h2>
<p>I've spent the majority of my career helping organizations in the social impact space get more out of their data. I use this website to share reflections on my work and what I'm learning.</p>
<p>On a given day you might find me tinkering with code, reading about AI fairness research, or petting my rescue dog.</p>
<p>Feel free to connect with me on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/niha-pereira/">Linkedin</a>, <a href="https://github.com/nnpereira">Github</a>, or <a href="https://bsky.app/profile/nnpereira.bsky.social">BlueSky</a>.</p>

    </content>
